 igible for Foundations of Practice credit for upper-level students only. V
 iew the Event Program Here Register for the Event Here Register for the Ha
 ckathon Here Conference Information and Accommodations The conference is l
 ocated on the fifth floor of the Burns Law Library in B505. Please arrive 
 at the library entrance and press the buzzer to be \nCategory: Lectures & 
 Speakers\nOriginal listing: https://calendar.gwu.edu/event/animals-technol
 ogy-law-2026-conference
