 ates
DESCRIPTION:Harmonizing Grace is Brown’s ONLY gospel choir. Since its la
 unch in 2013\, Harmonizing Grace Gospel Choir has been a home for singers
 \, musicians and instrumentalists alike. We perform both traditional and c
 ontemporary gospel music on campus - leading the congregation in worship a
 t the weekly Protestant Service in Manning as well as presenting during Br
 own’s annual Lessons & Carols in Sayles before Christmas - and in the su
 rrounding Providence area. Any and all levels of experience are welcome. J
 oin us every Sunday at Manning Chapel from 4 to 6pm for our weekly rehears
 als. No auditions required!\nCategory: Auditions and Rehearsals\nOriginal 
 listing: https://events.brown.edu/general/event/342043-harmonizing-grace-g
 ospel-choir-rehearsals
