BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Research Fundamentals: Plan Your Research — Providence
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261027T120000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00":20261027T125000
DTSTAMP:20261026T224242Z
UID:54287190560e704039b46d35d016@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Lectures\, Seminars and Workshops\,Providence\,
 United States
DESCRIPTION:Starting a research project can be stressful. Where do you beg
 in? How do you manage a project that spans months? Who can help along the 
 way? One way to alleviate that stress is to begin your research with a man
 ageable research plan. The goal of this workshop is to provide participant
 s with guidance and hands-on experience developing a manageable plan. The 
 workshop will address the following topics: * drafting and scoping an init
 ial research statement * identifying core research resources * developing 
 a project timeline * identifying networks of support. Event registration i
 s preferred. Please contact micah_saxton@brown.edu with any questions.\nCa
 tegory: Lectures\, Seminars and Workshops\nOriginal listing: https://event
 s.brown.edu/library/event/337679-research-fundamentals-plan-your-research
LOCATION:Rockefeller Library\, Rockefeller Library
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://events.brown.edu/library/event/337679-research-fundamentals-pl
 an-your-research
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:brown-arts
END:VEVENT
